  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>注意：這是 yanny 石器時代模組的非官方分支版本，旨在為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-winter-rescue\" rel=\"nofollow\">冬季救援模組包</a>提供相容性</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於原版模組似乎已在網路上消失很長一段時間，我們也曾嘗試提交 PR，因此有必要建立新的分支。80% 獎勵收入將歸於原作者（此設定已於專案設定中配置）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在修復錯誤與解決問題後，我們也將擴展模組內容</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分新功能包含改進的煉鐵爐與樹幹配方支援雙物品輸入</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">遵循與 Yanny 原版相同的 GNU GPL 3.0 協議發布與授權</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原始碼位於：<a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMoegMC/StoneAge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/TeamMoegMC/StoneAge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原始版本原始碼位於：<a href=\"https://github.com/yanny7/StoneAge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/yanny7/StoneAge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原始頁面位於：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stone-age-by-yanny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stone-age-by-yanny</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong>支持與聯繫我們</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BWn6E94\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/712310451408470098/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p><p>支持我們創造更多內容！</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TeamMoegProjects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fteammoeg\" rel=\"nofollow\">愛發電</a></p><p>您將在我們的網站上看到您的名字，並在我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/BWn6E94\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>中獲得特殊身分組</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finfo.teammoeg.com%252fsupportlist.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">支持者名單</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finfo.teammoeg.com%252fsupportlistgold.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">黃金支持者名單</a></p><p>除了 Discord，您也可以在此找到我們的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforum.teammoeg.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">TeamMoeg 論壇</a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
